      "message": "Because it is weird to modify lastActiveTime of Task by a getter-like method. It is better to correct the old code.\n\nIt looks like lastActiveTime is not a good choice to sort the task since multi-window support.\n\nHow about changing mTmpSortedSet so a simple ArrayList and use traverseTopToBottom\u003dtrue for forAllLeafTasks.\nAnd then\n```\nloop {\n  if (task \u003d\u003d focusedTask) continue;\n  if (task.isVisible()) {\n    mTmpVisibleTasks.add(task);\n  } else {\n    mTmpInvisibleTasks.add(task);\n  }\n}\nmTmpSortedList.add(focusedTask);\nmTmpSortedList.addAll(mTmpVisibleTasks);\nmTmpSortedList.addAll(mTmpInvisibleTasks);\n```",
