      "writtenOn": "2022-10-28T11:28:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree with you about active time is not a good choice to sort the task, And modified CL based on your comments.\nThere are two things that are different from your idea:\n1.mTmpInvisibleTasks also used ArrayList, because sorting by activie time doesn\u0027t look as good as by Task\u0027s hierarchy.\nIt may lead to questions: why visible and invisible are sorted differently.\n2.Use processTaskInWindowContainer instead of directly using forAllLeafTasks.\nThere are several reasons for this：\n   * When there are multiple DisplayContent there will be multiple focusedTask, I think it is better to return like this:\n   Top DisplayContent:{FocusTask, VisbleTask0...n, InvisbleTask0...n}\n   Bottom DisplayContent:{FocusTask, VisbleTask0...n, InvisbleTask0...n}\nin the same result List.\n   * If root is DisplayContent or other WindowContainer, use forAllLeafTasks directly",
